Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2 Step 2: Implement drv_target_table router and extract driver-DWDVR.s

Phase 2 Step 2 Deliverables:
- Refactor driver-FDCDVR.S into central storage router with drv_target_table (:0..:7)
- Extract DriveWire sector read, checksum, and write-protection logic into modular driver-DWDVR.s
- Implement get_drv_target helper for RDIN and DOWRIT
- Implement rd_local_sd and wr_local_sd stubs for Step 3 local SD integration
- Prune dead legacy RAM disk and network driver variables/routines to maintain strict memory bounds
- Export drv_target_table via equates-global-lowcore.s
- Maintain $$$org02E94663 section ceiling under 0x001300 with 17 bytes headroom

